{'symbol': 'UDR', 'date': '2022-09-13 14:13:00', 'title': "JUDGE ALLOWS YOUNG BLACK FORMER TENANT'S DISCRIMINATION CLAIMS AGAINST UDR TO ADVANCE", 'text': 'FILING ACCUSES NATIONWIDE APARTMENT OWNER OF RACIAL DISCRIMINATION AGAINST CRIME VICTIM WASHINGTON , SEPT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UDR INC. (NYSE: UDR), A LARGE NATIONAL REAL ESTATE CORPORATION, CANNOT SHAKE A DISCRIMINATION LAWSUIT THAT A FORMER TENANT FILED IN 2021 AFTER HE WAS FORCED TO VACATE THE PREMISES AFTER UNKNOWN ASSAILANTS SHOT HIM AT HIS WASHINGTON, D.C.'}